{"version":1,"key":"card:510","content":{"id":510,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"三维设计师必读书单推荐："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《像艺术家一样思考》"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"适合小白入门阅读，不仅教了绘画技巧，还讲了如何克服对绘画的恐惧，最重要的是书中提供了一种独特的思考方式，并不单纯的讲绘画技巧，而是从视觉感知的角度教读者如何观察事物"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《贝蒂的色彩》"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从书中认知到色彩的本质，用通俗易懂的方式把色彩原理简单化"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《色彩与光线》"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"材质表现和灯光渲染提升，关于色彩的思考和对主题情感的表达有思考和开拓的意义"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《艺用人体结构》"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"角色建模师必须要看的人体解剖书籍，把人体的肌肉概括成各种体块方式，适合三维建模师去理解和使用"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《动画人的生成手册》"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"市面上讲解动画最好的一本书籍，动画教材中的权威"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《生命的幻想》"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"涵盖了动画发展史，迪士尼动画工作室的历程，深入分析了动画角色表现、情感性格等人物设定方面动画如何去表达"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["书籍推荐/设计师"],"createTime":1731150187737,"updateTime":1753010529414,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1753010529414}}